Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:38.02,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=5}{\fscx926\fscy926\an7\fn思源黑体 Medium\fs5\b0\pos(611.88,669.74)\c&H3D01FC&\3c&H3D01FC&\bord0.93\blur4.63\3a&H7B&}使用者之状态并非此药治疗范围故无效果
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.02,0:21:38.06,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=5}{\fscx926\fscy926\an7\fn思源黑体 Medium\fs5\b0\pos(612.24,669.6)\c&H3D01FC&\3c&H3D01FC&\bord0.93\blur4.63\3a&H7B&}使用者之状态并非此药治疗范围故无效果
